  "limitations": [
    "Process attribution is not exclusive VRAM; never sum bytes across PIDs or adapter LUIDs.",
    "Dedicated, Shared and Total Committed remain separate counters; Total Committed is not a residency measurement.",
    "Absent or exited PID counters are missing, not zero. LUID order is not CUDA device order.",
    "Each boundary waits 150 ms before sampling; transient request peaks are not captured and request timing is diagnostic.",
    "Only recorded PCM hashes are compared here; the probe did not save audio files for fresh waveform analysis.",
    "Recorded source hashes identify the executed probe even if current cleanup code changes later."
  ]
